@title Help icons: a short "?" popup keeps its natural size, no gap and no scrollbar at 1366x768
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# The Heat strip "?" (top left of the 3D workspace) has a three-line text: it must fill its popup, with no empty strip below and no scrollbar (look at the picture).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
try click_text Cancel
wait 10
click 110 73
wait 8
expect "fills this strip"
shot short-popup
click 700 690
wait 6
expect_not "fills this strip"
